+# UnderWeb X network manifest contract
+
+UWX v0.3 reads an optional JSON feed from:
+
+`GET https://underweb.cloud/api/uwx/manifest`
+
+The client must continue working when this endpoint is missing or offline. UWX caches the last successful payload in its local SQLite config store.
+
+## Example payload
+
+```json
+{
+  "schemaVersion": "1",
+  "generatedAt": "2026-09-23T22:00:00Z",
+  "self": {
+    "underwebUserId": "profile-id",
+    "displayName": "Darko",
+    "vrchat": { "id": "usr_..." },
+    "discord": { "id": "123456", "username": "darko" }
+  },
+  "members": [
+    {
+      "underwebUserId": "profile-id",
+      "vrchatUserId": "usr_...",
+      "displayName": "Darko",
+      "roles": ["Owner"],
+      "creatorTypes": ["World Creator"],
+      "badges": ["Verified"],
+      "staff": true,
+      "partner": false
+    }
+  ],
+  "events": [
+    {
+      "id": "event-id",
+      "title": "UnderWeb Night",
+      "status": "live",
+      "startAt": "2026-09-24T02:00:00Z",
+      "endAt": "2026-09-24T06:00:00Z",
+      "worldId": "wrld_...",
+      "groupId": "grp_...",
+      "instanceTag": "wrld_...:123~group(grp_...)",
+      "host": "UnderWeb",
+      "posterUrl": "https://...",
+      "staff": ["usr_..."],
+      "performers": ["usr_..."]
+    }
+  ],
+  "release": {
+    "version": "0.3.0",
+    "downloadUrl": "https://..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Unknown fields are ignored. Missing arrays are treated as empty. Role matching is case-insensitive and deliberately tolerant of role names such as Owner, Director, Admin, Moderator, Staff, Security, Event Lead, DJ, Photographer, Avatar Creator, World Creator, Artist, Partner, and similar creator roles.
